/// known-gap: interp a missing token is an error (R0301 token-not-found) instead of nil
/// resolve_token on an unregistered token (or namespace) gives nil (owner ruling 2026-10-06).
:register_token("THEME", "ACCENT", "purple")
say(:resolve_token("THEME", "MISSING"))
say(:resolve_token("NOPE", "ACCENT"))
